## 10. Statistical analysis
1. Construct the nested trials at each origin and assemble the stacked, trial-indexed dataset (one record per patient per trial they enter).
2. Within each trial, estimate the propensity score from covariates measured at that origin and apply weighting (or matching); check balance within trial.
